# RPV Data

Due to the large size of the dataset, the raw data files are not included in this repository.

The full dataset **RPV_40Cities** is available for download via Baidu Pan:

- **Link:** https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ehbNDUysrVOe0yD-NGFOag?pwd=RPVD
- **Extraction Code:** `RPVD`

Please download and place the data files in this directory before running any scripts.

## Directory Structure

The dataset is organized by city. Each city has its own subdirectory containing a compressed archive of the corresponding data:

```
RPV_40Cities/
├── CityA/
│   └── CityA.zip
├── CityB/
│   └── CityB.zip
└── ...
```

Extract the required city archives into their respective subdirectories before use.
